{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Your sorrow.</b> This is the pain of raising children (Eiruvin 100)." "<b>And your pregnancy.</b> This is the pain of pregnancy." "<b>In pain shall you bear children.</b> This is the pain of childbirth." "<b>And to your husband shall be your desire.</b> For relations — yet you do not have the audacity to demand it verbally; rather, he shall rule over you — everything is from him and not from you." "<b>Your desire.</b> Your craving, as in ״נֶפֶשׁ שׁוֹקֵקָה״ (Isaiah 29)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:57:25.257850460Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}